{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02769","headline":"和王奭秋夜有所思 · 卢照邻","name":"和王奭秋夜有所思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寂南轩夜，悠然怀所知。\n长河落雁苑，明月下鲸池。\n凤台有清曲，此曲何人吹？\n丹唇间玉齿，妙响入云涯。\n穷巷秋风叶，空庭寒露枝。\n劳歌欲有和，星鬓已将垂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02769.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02769","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}